    <description>Brewster is an internal problem-solver for store equipment issues. Brewster detects the user’s information, including their store and its related assets. If there’s a problem with an asset, Brewster gathers details about the issue and creates an Equipment Malfunction case. Brewster then researches the case against recent similar cases and incorporates information like store conditions,  recommending to repair or replace the equipment. Based on the user-manager&apos;s decision, Brewster either creates a repair task or kicks off a replacement approval request.</description>
