        <fullName>Equipment_Case_Management_16jg7000001KQsD</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Use this subagent when a store manager reports broken, malfunctioning, or damaged equipment, or asks to create, check, or work on an equipment issue or case for their store.
Examples: &quot;our coffee machine is broken,&quot; &quot;the espresso machine stopped working,&quot; &quot;I need to report equipment that isn&apos;t working,&quot; &quot;help me create a case for a broken machine.&quot;
This subagent gathers the asset and store details, creates an Equipment Malfunction case, researches similar past cases, store conditions, recommends whether to repair or replace, and takes action based on the store manager&apos;s decision.</description>
